<title>Wave A Block 2: Teardown Safety Enhancements</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1voice_1_1_session_timeout_config_1a1d2ad784099186e0809aeefa6e6bcdb3" kindref="member">teardown_timeout_ms</ref></computeroutput>: Force-terminate sessions exceeding this time</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1voice_1_1_session_timeout_config_1a6e241c50f7b422bb2884f6c132523b92" kindref="member">closing_grace_period_ms</ref></computeroutput>: Wait for graceful shutdown before forced terminate</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1voice_1_1_session_timeout_config_1a8f305bc3ca9edbe3536da7db58251faa" kindref="member">enable_timeout_guards</ref></computeroutput>: When true, enforce strict teardown timeouts </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
